+// TestHegelInsertsBeforeWideCellsKeepTheRow: inserting a narrow cell before a row of wide
+// cells on a terminal without ICH leaves the row as the screen has it on a terminal honouring
+// IRM (cellbuf/18: transformLine's wide-cell adjustment steps the insert point back onto the
+// wide head it has just written and inserts it a second time); under HEGEL_NO_KNOWN=1 the
+// terminal has ICH or the cells are narrow.
